MODULE: StagingNamesBoundLogLogicalTag
TARGET: StagingNamesBoundLog
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: staging tags a prepare with the logical or retired source instead of its bound physical log
PERTURBS: Stage

--- FIND
    /\ staged' = TRUE /\ stageOrigin' = bound /\ read' = read + 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ staged' = TRUE /\ stageOrigin' = 3 - bound /\ read' = read + 1
--- END
